MB as a result. Logcat verbose logs (DirectGuruBridge, SatsangManager step timings) will not appear in this build - if any issue surfaces, next iteration should re-enable Dev Build for diagnostic capture. (5) Behaviour validation targets - Satsang response latency 3-4s end-to-end (post Pinecone removal from build 671), no doha truncation due to max_tokens=250, Anisha plays new speaking gesture during audio with smooth Idle/SatsangSpeaking transitions, both Hindi and English personas produce authentic dohas/shlokas without fabrications.", "created_date": 1777240344, "id": "35612832118301895", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 673, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "32526571810261290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35612832118301895"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777231721, "id": "35610720765179697", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 671, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 11}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "32526571810261290", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "35612832118301895"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1777142435, "id": "35587598230825284", "version": "1.4.1", "version_code": 669, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": 